(7759518, 1284674, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting melding of curve and straight line, they actually look comfortable together.  And the outskirts, calm in its own nature.  Fine composition, not quite balanced because of the slanted perspective, and more provocative for it.  Nice title, modest and full.  The colors are gorgeous, just wonderful.  Who needs Faberge?<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.  (10)</td>', 'Interesting melding of curve and straight line, they actually look comfortable together.  And the outskirts, calm in its own nature.  Fine composition, not quite balanced because of the slanted perspective, and more provocative for it.  Nice title, modest and full.  The colors are gorgeous, just wonderful.  Who needs Faberge?Personal favorite of the challenge.  (10)', '2023-10-31 10:18:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7759638, 1284486, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Its tough to get an 8 second exposure and not have messy branches and leaves. You must have had a calm day. Processing is great here; not too overdone</td>', 'Beautiful image. Its tough to get an 8 second exposure and not have messy branches and leaves. You must have had a calm day. Processing is great here; not too overdone', '2023-11-04 09:39:30.000000', NULL, 0),
